{"steam_appid":1374680,"steam_name":"Hazard Levels","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1374680/682516355/f0873711e6065d54eed0198573058b89fb04c1da/1794483774/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1794486300","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257503434/a8f9b8d32a8933616bd7f61ffff978535ee440c7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1794486300","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/3b59c2f1f418469ce2db872828c17d673225f5f1/ss_3b59c2f1f418469ce2db872828c17d673225f5f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794675682","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/bfae74e923929c0a340479f1a90ffba88f0bf06d/ss_bfae74e923929c0a340479f1a90ffba88f0bf06d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794675682","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/ac73c4123e47dd007648759d7541dac86281c183/ss_ac73c4123e47dd007648759d7541dac86281c183.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794675682","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/c2bf049961b5ed976b9bf1ebab15ad7b0125d921/ss_c2bf049961b5ed976b9bf1ebab15ad7b0125d921.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794675682","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/d2e79483aaa20f3281b09d7597aa0c5bacaa3487/ss_d2e79483aaa20f3281b09d7597aa0c5bacaa3487.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794675682"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden deep below the Fox Hole Arms, a research division known only as The Family sends recruits into unstable interdimensional rifts to harvest rare and bizarre ingredients. Step into the unknown alone or with up to three friends as you explore unpredictable rift dimensions, evade the creatures within, and grab whatever strange loot you can carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/146876144d8211acf202e79a113b26fa.avif?t=1794675682\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras_big/146876144d8211acf202e79a113b26fa.webp?t=1794675682 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/af8ee72610fc9a970ef823816199127f.poster.avif?t=1794675682\" aria-label=\"A player explores a dark, purple-lit alien environment filled with strange vegetation in Hazard Levels.\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/af8ee72610fc9a970ef823816199127f.webm?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/af8ee72610fc9a970ef823816199127f.mp4?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 PLAYER CO-OP HORROR WITH PROX CHAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to three friends to tackle the horrors of each rift. Coordination is key, survival is not guaranteed. Proximity voice chat enabled. Supports both third and first person play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/8c560448c523cfdcb2dcff70871b25a4.poster.avif?t=1794675682\" aria-label=\"A player navigates an eerie, blue-lit interdimensional environment during a Hazard Levels expedition.\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/8c560448c523cfdcb2dcff70871b25a4.webm?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/8c560448c523cfdcb2dcff70871b25a4.mp4?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROCEDURALLY GENERATED RIFT DIMENSIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two expeditions are the same. Each rift generates new biomes, shifting layouts, randomised hazards, and escalating threats that force your team to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/a846ddfb1db437476903d55aa32a8b36.poster.avif?t=1794675682\" aria-label=\"First-person Hazard Levels gameplay showing the Gravity Gauntlet interacting with objects in a glowing purple rift.\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/a846ddfb1db437476903d55aa32a8b36.webm?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/a846ddfb1db437476903d55aa32a8b36.mp4?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS-BASED LOOTING </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Gravity Gauntlet to grab, carry, and throw multiple objects at once. Harvest bizarre rift-grown ingredients and sell them at rift stations while surviving the creatures that stalk each dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/64c772c67a66ec48114a7ee1858c96db.poster.avif?t=1794675682\" aria-label=\"A glowing purple experimental drink is prepared at a workstation in Hazard Levels.\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/64c772c67a66ec48114a7ee1858c96db.webm?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/64c772c67a66ec48114a7ee1858c96db.mp4?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREW SPECIAL DRINKS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a hard day’s work, bring back your otherworldly ingredients to brew at Brewdragon’s Secret Brewery. Complete orders to develop and level up the potency of your brews. Some grant powerful abilities… others cause complete chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/ff2557614ee32dfa9ab2b2ad22126501.poster.avif?t=1794675682\" aria-label=\"A player explores an otherworldly dimension filled with purple lighting and unusual environmental hazards.\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/ff2557614ee32dfa9ab2b2ad22126501.webm?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/ff2557614ee32dfa9ab2b2ad22126501.mp4?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT TO SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying creatures lurk within every dimension. Study their behaviour, learn their weaknesses, and use your weapons strategically to survive deadly encounters. Choose when to fight and when to keep your distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/42c24517378cbbcfdc4a529e011c499c.poster.avif?t=1794675682\" aria-label=\"A bright blue dimensional portal opens during an expedition in Hazard Levels.\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/42c24517378cbbcfdc4a529e011c499c.webm?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/42c24517378cbbcfdc4a529e011c499c.mp4?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RIFT SCANNING &amp; PORTALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your state-of-the-art Rift Scanner to locate dimensional anomalies, then deploy a Rift Stabilising Device to tear open unstable portals. Step through and discover what waits on the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/2b9d58b5780cceff5e7c0ca63e435d94.poster.avif?t=1794675682\" aria-label=\"Masked characters stand inside the Fox Hole Arms, the British pub that serves as the base in Hazard Levels.\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/2b9d58b5780cceff5e7c0ca63e435d94.webm?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374680/extras/2b9d58b5780cceff5e7c0ca63e435d94.mp4?t=1794675682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FOX HOLE ARMS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your HQ is a traditional British pub hiding the Family’s secret R&amp;D facility. Between expeditions customise your outfit, mix perk drinks, review mission intel, or drop a coin in the jukebox. Just don’t piss off the Landlord.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8.1, 10 (64-bit required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 / AMD Radeon R7 260x with 2GB Video RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Wales Interactive"],"publishers":["Wales Interactive"],"release_date":"Nov 12, 2026"}